<title>GREECE: Greek WPI inflation falls to 3.1pct y/y in Jan.</title>
<headline>Greek WPI inflation falls to 3.1pct y/y in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's January wholesale price inflation fell to 3.1 percent year-on-year from 3.9 percent in December, the National Statistics Service (NSS) said in a statement.  </p>
<p>    Wholesale price index   Jan 97   Dec 96   Jan 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month (pct)     0.7	0.3	1.5</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
